<p style="margin:0; text-align:center;"><img src="https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg724b63244550007/dronebox2/web/upload/NNEditor/20260918/464a24454a90c7b56cc2ea0a12a1e440.jpg" alt="DJI SDR 트랜스미션 2 (SDR Transmission 2) Auto Channel 자동 채널 관리" style="max-width:100%; display:block; margin:0 auto;" loading="lazy"></p>
<h3 style="font-size:21px; font-weight:700; margin:40px 0 14px; padding-bottom:8px; border-bottom:2px solid #E3E6EB;">주요 스펙</h3>
<p style="font-size:15px; color:#333D4B; margin:0 0 12px;">아래 수치는 DJI 공식 제품 페이지에 공개된 값입니다.</p>
<div style="overflow-x:auto;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;"><tr><th style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; width:32%; vertical-align:top;">무게</th><td style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28;">약 136g (안테나 포함)</td></tr><tr><th style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; width:32%; vertical-align:top;">크기</th><td style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28;">76×61×25mm (L×W×H, 안테나·콜드슈 어댑터 제외)</td></tr><tr><th style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; width:32%; vertical-align:top;">최대 전송 거리</th><td style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28;">4km (CE) · 3km (FCC)</td></tr><tr><th style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; width:32%; vertical-align:top;">최소 영상 전송 지연</th><td style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28;">35ms</td></tr><tr><th style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; width:32%; vertical-align:top;">최대 인코딩 비트레이트</th><td style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28;">50Mbps</td></tr><tr><th style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; width:32%; vertical-align:top;">동영상 코딩 형식</th><td style="padding:10px 14px;