er:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; width:32%; vertical-align:top;">전원 공급</th><td style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28;">USB-C PD 15V 3A · DC 6.8~17.5V · NP-F 배터리 6.8~8.4V</td></tr><tr><th style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; width:32%; vertical-align:top;">오디오 출력</th><td style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28;">16-bit, 48kHz 스테레오 PCM</td></tr><tr><th style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; width:32%; vertical-align:top;">동시 연결</th><td style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28;">송신기 1대 → 수신기 최대 8대</td></tr><tr><th style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; width:32%; vertical-align:top;">모드 전환</th><td style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28;">송신기(TX) · 수신기(RX) 전환 사용</td></tr><tr><th style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; width:32%; vertical-align:top;">연동 짐벌</th><td style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; background:#FFFFFF; color:#191F28;">DJI RS 5, RS 4 Pro, RS 4, RS 3 Pro, Ronin 2, Master Wheels</td></tr><tr><th style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px; text-align:left; background:#F7F8FA; color:#191F28; width:32%; vertical-align:top;">연동 카메라</th><td style="padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid #E3E6EB; font-size:15px